-- title:
--   Unramified layers in an open subgroup of G_{ℚ_q}
-- statement:
--   Fix primes $p$ and $q$, and write $G_q = \operatorname{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}_p[q]}(\mathrm{PadicAlgCl}\,q)$ for the group `primeLocalGaloisGroup q` of $\mathbb{Q}_q$-algebra automorphisms of the chosen algebraic closure of $\mathbb{Q}_q$. Let $S \le G_q$ be a subgroup which is assumed to contain the preimage, under the homomorphism `primeLocalToGlobal q` (restriction of scalars to $\mathbb{Q}$ followed by restriction to the normal subextension $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$), of the fixing subgroup of some intermediate field $F_0$ of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}/\mathbb{Q}$ with $[F_0:\mathbb{Q}]$ finite. Let $N \ge 1$. For $M \ge 1$ put $U_M \le S$ for the preimage under the inclusion $S \hookrightarrow G_q$ of the subgroup fixing the field $\mathbb{Q}_q(\{\zeta : \zeta^{q^M-1} = 1\})$ generated by the $(q^M-1)$-st roots of unity. The conclusion is the conjunction of six assertions: $U_N$ is normal in $S$; $U_N$ has finite index in $S$; there is an intermediate field $F$ of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}/\mathbb{Q}$ with $[F:\mathbb{Q}]$ finite such that the preimage of its fixing subgroup under $S \hookrightarrow G_q$ followed by `primeLocalToGlobal q` lies in $U_N$; there is $\varphi \in S$ with every $g \in S$ of the form $\varphi^n u$ for some $n \in \mathbb{Z}$ and $u \in U_N$; $U_{N'} \le U_N$ whenever $N \mid N'$; and there is $N' > 0$ with $N \mid N'$ and $p$ dividing the relative index of $U_{N'}$ in $U_N$.
--
--   This packages the standard properties of the unramified layers $K(\mu_{q^M-1})$ over the finite extension $K/\mathbb{Q}_q$ cut out by the open subgroup $S$: normality and finite index, openness in the form of a global finite-level bound, cyclicity of the quotient generated by a Frobenius, monotonicity in $N$, and the existence of a multiple $N'$ of $N$ for which the index is divisible by $p$. It is used in the local-at-$q$ steps of the cohomological argument, by [`groupCohomology.continuousH2MapHom_surjective_of_surjective_of_primeLocal`](thm.html#groupCohomology.continuousH2MapHom_surjective_of_surjective_of_primeLocal) and by [`groupCohomology.exists_forall_restrict_comap_rootsOfUnity_mem_levelCoboundaries2_of_primeLocal`](thm.html#groupCohomology.exists_forall_restrict_comap_rootsOfUnity_mem_levelCoboundaries2_of_primeLocal).
